    "description": "“I'm just a visual learner”? In 2008, a major review found little evidence that teaching to a learning style improves results. Among 426 anatomy students, learning-style scores were unrelated to performance. What remains undisputed, plus one small action.",
    "companion_text": "Every method with a source.",
